    "Use tab to navigate through the menu items.",
    "ABOUT US",
    "At Quality/Quantity Barbershop, we\u2019re two passionate barbers who met at barber school and instantly clicked. What began as a friendship has grown into a successful business partnership built on a shared vision: delivering top-notch, personalized service to every client. We opened our first location in Pflugerville, Texas, with humble beginnings, focusing on creating a comfortable space where the community could come for exceptional haircuts and grooming. As we grew, our commitment to quality over quantity remained at the heart of everything we do, which is why we chose the name \"Quality/Quantity\"\u2014to reflect our dedication to craftsmanship over cutting corners.",
    "After establishing a strong foundation in Pflugerville, we expanded our reach with our newest location in North Lamar, Austin, Texas. This move was a natural step as we continued to prioritize quality in every aspect of our business. Our clients trust us not only for our skills but for the genuine relationships we build with them. Whether it's your first visit or you're a returning regular, our focus is always on providing the best experience possible, with attention to detail and a friendly, professional atmosphere. At Quality/Quantity, it\u2019s not just about the cut; it\u2019s about building long-lasting connections and offering a standard of excellence that speaks for itself.",
